⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of Roxie Richter
node SPW · SPW · ⟦Roxie Richter:SPW:8eb2a3⟧

WHO   — Roxie Richter — the half-ninja
WHAT  — The boss Scott can't bring himself to hit, defeated only when Ramona puppets his hands — and who throws the ‘it was just a phase’ dismissal back in their faces.
WHERE — SPW · Scott Pilgrim vs. the World  Framework inputs: Scott Pilgrim vs. the World (2010); O'Malley's graphic novels  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the relationship people most want to call ‘a phase’ is exactly the one that demands to be taken seriously.
HOW   — By half-ninja speed, smoke, and a blade — and by the very real hurt of being someone's deniable history.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  Don't you dare call me a phase — I'm a little bi-furious, and I will not be waved away.

